# Environment setup (branch → Supabase project)
#
#   main branch    → production  → GammaQuality
#   staging branch → staging     → GammaQuality-Staging
#
# 1. Run:  npm run env:sync
# 2. Edit the created .env.<mode>.local file with keys from Supabase Dashboard → API
# 3. Run:  npm run dev          (uses staging on staging branch, production on main)

# See templates:
#   .env.production.example  — GammaQuality (main)
#   .env.staging.example     — GammaQuality-Staging (staging)
